#---
# purpose: "Integer.parse/1 refuses a digit run that overflows 64 bits before the sign is applied, negative or positive, with ArgumentError. Elixir returns the bignum, so this fixture has no oracle"
# expect: abort
#---
def main() do
  dbg(Integer.parse("-9223372036854775808"))
  dbg(Integer.parse("-9223372036854775809"))
end
